{"analytics_identifier":null,"base_path":"/product-safety-alerts-reports-recalls/product-safety-report-machinery-automation-vertical-form-fill-and-seal-vffs-machine-2604-0005","content_id":"5c0b060c-c4fd-48f9-a6ef-c3125896f42f","description":"Product Safety Report for Machinery Automation Vertical Form Fill & Seal (VFFS) Machine presenting a risk of electric shock and burns. ","details":{"attachments":[{"attachment_type":"file","content_id":"2c624d06-94b4-4c22-a459-f4722b579262","content_type":"application/pdf","created_at":"2026-05-08T12:26:04+01:00","id":"2c624d06-94b4-4c22-a459-f4722b579262","title":"Link to product image and PDF","updated_at":"2026-05-08T12:26:04+01:00","url":"https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/media/69fdc84c81a251700a20b2ad/2604-0005-product-safety-report-machinery-automation-vertical-form-fill-and-seal-machine.pdf"}],"body":"<h2 id=\"summary\">Summary</h2>\n\n<p>Product: Machinery Automation Vertical Form Fill &amp; Seal (VFFS) Machine</p>\n\n<p>Hazard: The product presents a risk of electric shock because it does not incorporate adequate protective earthing, meaning the machine frame and body could become live in the event of an electrical fault.</p>\n\n<p>Corrective action: The machine has been identified as unsafe in its current condition, and its continued use presents a risk of serious injury. The manufacturer has provided customers with information about the safety risks identified with the machine, and customers have been advised to contact the manufacturer regarding appropriate modifications.</p>\n\n<h2 id=\"product-information\">Product information</h2>\n\n<table>\n  <thead>\n    <tr>\n      <th scope=\"col\">Type</th>\n      <th scope=\"col\">Machinery – Packaging Machinery</th>\n    </tr>\n  </thead>\n  <tbody>\n    <tr>\n      <td>Brand</td>\n      <td>Machinery Automation Limited</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td>Country of Origin</td>\n      <td>United Kingdom</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td>Product Description</td>\n      <td>Vertical form, fill and seal machine.</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td>Product Report and Image</td>\n      <td><span id=\"attachment_2c624d06-94b4-4c22-a459-f4722b579262\" class=\"attachment-inline\"><a href=\"https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/media/69fdc84c81a251700a20b2ad/2604-0005-product-safety-report-machinery-automation-vertical-form-fill-and-seal-machine.pdf\">Link to product image and PDF</a></span></td>\n    </tr>\n  </tbody>\n</table>\n\n<h2 id=\"hazard\">Hazard</h2>\n\n<p>The product presents a risk of electric shock because:</p>\n\n<ul>\n  <li>It does not incorporate adequate protective earthing, meaning the machine frame and body could become live in the event of an electrical fault.</li>\n  <li>Cabinet doors are secured only by plastic latches, allowing ready access to live electrical parts during operation.</li>\n  <li>External electrical cables are not adequately supported or protected and may become damaged, exposing live conductors.</li>\n  <li>Electrical connections can detach easily, and cables pass through apertures without suitable protection, increasing the risk of live conductors contacting the metal casing.</li>\n  <li>Electrical cables were not consistently colour‑coded, increasing the risk of unsafe work during maintenance or repair.</li>\n</ul>\n\n<p>The product also presents a risk of serious injury from burns, crushing or entanglement because:</p>\n\n<ul>\n  <li>There are no safeguards to prevent contact with hazardous moving and heated parts.</li>\n  <li>Users may come into contact with heated clamping and sealing jaws and in‑running nip points formed by rotating elements.</li>\n  <li>The absence of a suitable emergency stop prevents the machine from being stopped quickly in an emergency.</li>\n</ul>\n\n<p>The product does not meet the requirements of the Supply of Machinery (Safety) Regulations 2008.</p>\n\n<h2 id=\"corrective-action\">Corrective action</h2>\n\n<p>The machine has been identified as unsafe in its current condition, and its continued use presents a risk of serious injury. The manufacturer has provided customers with information about the safety risks identified with the machine, and customers have been advised to contact the manufacturer regarding appropriate modifications.</p>\n\n<h3 id=\"additional-information\">Additional information</h3>\n\n<p>PSD notification number: 2604-0005</p>\n\n<p>Notified by: Health and Safety Executive</p>\n","change_history":[{"note":"First published.","public_timestamp":"2026-05-08T11:26:47Z"}],"headers":[{"id":"summary","level":2,"text":"Summary"},{"id":"product-information","level":2,"text":"Product information"},{"id":"hazard","level":2,"text":"Hazard"},{"headers":[{"id":"additional-information","level":3,"text":"Additional information"}],"id":"corrective-action","level":2,"text":"Corrective action"}],"max_cache_time":10,"metadata":{"product_alert_type":"product-safety-report","product_category":"machinery","product_measure_type":["other"],"product_recall_alert_date":"2026-05-08","product_risk_level":"serious"},"temporary_update_type":false},"document_type":"product_safety_alert_report_recall","first_published_at":"2026-05-08T12:26:47+01:00","links":{"available_translations":[{"api_path":"/api/content/product-safety-alerts-reports-recalls/product-safety-report-machinery-automation-vertical-form-fill-and-seal-vffs-machine-2604-0005","api_url":"https://www.gov.uk/api/content/product-safety-alerts-reports-recalls/product-safety-report-machinery-automation-vertical-form-fill-and-seal-vffs-machine-2604-0005","base_path":"/product-safety-alerts-reports-recalls/product-safety-report-machinery-automation-vertical-form-fill-and-seal-vffs-machine-2604-0005","content_id":"5c0b060c-c4fd-48f9-a6ef-c3125896f42f","document_type":"product_safety_alert_report_recall","links":{},"locale":"en","public_updated_at":"2026-05-08T11:26:47Z","schema_name":"specialist_document","title":"Product Safety Report: Machinery Automation Vertical Form Fill & Seal (VFFS) Machine (2604-0005)","web_url":"https://www.gov.uk/product-safety-alerts-reports-recalls/product-safety-report-machinery-automation-vertical-form-fill-and-seal-vffs-machine-2604-0005","withdrawn":false}],"finder":[{"api_path":"/api/content/product-safety-alerts-reports-recalls","api_url":"https://www.gov.uk/api/content/product-safety-alerts-reports-recalls","base_path":"/product-safety-alerts-reports-recalls","content_id":"a22b3f1f-2c91-49a1-a469-ff21d465c543","details":{"facets":[{"allowed_values":[{"label":"Product safety alert","value":"product-safety-alert"},{"label":"Product safety report","value":"product-safety-report"},{"label":"Product recall","value":"product-recall"}],"display_as_result_metadata":true,"filterable":true,"key":"product_alert_type","name":"Alert type","preposition":"of type","short_name":"Alert type","type":"text"},{"allowed_values":[{"label":"Serious","value":"serious"},{"label":"High","value":"high"},{"label":"Medium","value":"medium"},{"label":"Low","value":"low"},{"label":"Not provided","value":"not-provided"}],"display_as_result_metadata":true,"filterable":true,"key":"product_risk_level","name":"Risk level","preposition":"that are","short_name":"Risk level","type":"text"},{"allowed_values":[{"label":"Adaptors, Plugs and Sockets","value":"adaptors-plugs-sockets"},{"label":"Chemical products","value":"chemical-products"},{"label":"Childcare articles and children's equipment","value":"childcare-articles-childrens-equipment"},{"label":"Clothing, textiles and fashion items","value":"clothing-textiles-fashion"},{"label":"Communication and media equipment","value":"communication-media-equipment"},{"label":"Construction products","value":"construction-products"},{"label":"Cosmetics","value":"cosmetics"},{"label":"Electrical appliances and equipment","value":"electrical-appliances-equipment"},{"label":"Entertainment and leisure products (indoors)","value":"entertainment-leisure-products-indoors"},{"label":"Entertainment and leisur